  "contentHtml": "<p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">과학 교사인데도 과학과&nbsp;업무를</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"> 멀리하며 지내왔네요... ^^;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">이번에 과학업무를 처음 맡았는데(그동안 하신 분들이 전출가셔서 제가...ㅜ.ㅜ)</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">&nbsp;</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">당장 3월에 계획해야 하는 게 청소년과학탐구대회 교내 예선이더라고요.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">사실 작년까지 보니까 기계과학 부문은 학생들 참가율이 적어서 많아봐야 10명 간신히 넘더라고요.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">그 밖에도 참가율이 저조한 교내 과학대회들이 몇몇 있습니다.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">그런데 시상을 하고자 하니 몇 명을 줄지가 애매한 부분이 있어서요.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">공문을 보니 2016학년도 </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\">내신성적 대회시상 지침과 2018학년도 내신성적 지침(예고안)이 달라서(아래 밑줄친 부분)&nbsp;고민에 빠졌습니다. ㅜ.ㅜ</span></p><p><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt;\"><br></span></p><!--StartFragment--><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-align: left; font-size: 11pt; -ms-text-autospace:; -ms-word-break: keep-all; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;\"><strong><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2016</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년도 고입내신성적 반영지침과 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">2018</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">학년도 고입내신성적 반영지침</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">(</span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">예고안</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: 0pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\">) </span><span style=\"font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 함초롬바탕;\">교내 대회 시상관련</span></strong></p><table style=\"border-right-color: currentColor; border-bottom-color: currentColor; border-left-color: currentColor; border-right-width: medium; border-bottom-width: medium; border-left-width: medium; border-right-style: none; border-bottom-style: none; border-left-style: none; border-collapse: collapse; mso-table-overlap: never;\"><tbody><tr><td valign=\"top\" style=\"padding: 1.41pt 5.1pt; border: 0.28pt solid rgb(0, 0, 0); width: 206.76pt; height: 199.4pt;\"><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: 10pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\"><strong>2016학년도</strong></span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: 10pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3. </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">각</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종 교내 대회의 영역별</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종목별</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시상 횟수는</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\"> </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기당 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">1</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">회로 제한하며</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">학기당 수상인원은 영역</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">별</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">종목별</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">) </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">실제 참가인원의 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">5% </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">이내로 한다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.8pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: 10pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\">  </span><u><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">단</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">대회의 참가인원은 최하 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">10</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명 이상으로 하고</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">, </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">참가인원이 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">10</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명이상 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">60</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명 이하인 경우는 </span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">3</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">명을 시상할 수 있다</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">.</span></u></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"text-indent: -10pt; letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-size: 11pt; margin-top: 1pt; margin-bottom: 1pt; margin-left: 10pt; -ms-text-autospace:; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\"><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%;\">  </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체; mso-hansi-font-family: 굴림체;\">※ </span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">시상은 수상인원 범위 내에서 등급별</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">(1, 2, 3</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">등급</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 굴림체;\">)</span><span style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,굴림,AppleGothic,sans-serif; font-size: 10pt; mso-font-width: 95%; mso-fareast-font-family: 굴림체;\">로 할 수 있지만</span><span  style=\"letter-spacing: -0.5pt; font-family: Gulim,